  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant used equipment to illegally produce and sell tax invoices that can be used for tax deduction and other purposes. This conduct matches the statutory offense of illegally manufacturing and selling invoices (including falsified tax invoices). The prosecution charges the defendant with the crime of illegal manufacturing and selling of invoices, which is the appropriate charge under the Criminal Law.",
